:888,"depth":1176,"text":889},{"id":1123,"depth":1176,"text":1124},"What the Wolf Agent detects in nginx access logs and the auth log, which bench services and site settings it reports as exposed, and which presets alert on them.","md",null,{},{"icon":137},{"title":134,"description":1194},"OMNtbOocW2f1KtjmHys08x_l8FQ5MkDMYWxNwgnoEM8",[1202,1204],{"title":129,"path":130,"stem":131,"description":1203,"icon":132},"Turn on the security signals the Wolf site captures by itself, with no agent, and set up the GeoIP database for new-country logins.",{"title":139,"path":140,"stem":141,"description":1205,"icon":142},"Give people the right Wolf role, limit a Wolf User to some sites, benches or hosts, and manage agent secrets and the push rate limit.",1794953319032]